89e90149-d21a-40e9-8f9b-87718d84826c	\N	4303ee95-1fcd-4bb1-9af2-c27700a11bf4	\N	agency_ask	[{"role": "user", "content": "What Nigerian market trends should we be tracking?", "timestamp": "2026-07-24T09:48:07.091Z"}, {"role": "aria", "content": "# Nigerian Market Trends to Track\\n\\nGiven the current landscape, here are the **key trends** most relevant to brand performance in Nigeria:\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📱 Digital & Consumer Behavior\\n- **Mobile-first consumption** — 85%+ of Nigerian internet users are mobile-only; content and campaigns must be optimized accordingly\\n- **Social commerce growth** — Instagram, TikTok, and WhatsApp are increasingly driving purchase decisions\\n- **Short-form video dominance** — TikTok and Instagram Reels are outperforming static content significantly\\n\\n## 💰 Economic & Purchasing Trends\\n- **Price sensitivity** — Naira fluctuation is reshaping consumer spending priorities and brand loyalty\\n- **Value-for-money messaging** resonates stronger than premium positioning in current climate\\n- **Sachet economy** — Smaller pack sizes and flexible pricing models are gaining traction\\n\\n## 🏙️ Demographic Shifts\\n- **Youth demographic (18-35)** remains the dominant consumer segment — digital-native expectations\\n- **Tier 2 city growth** — Ibadan, Enugu, Port Harcourt markets are expanding beyond Lagos\\n\\n## 📊 Platform Intelligence\\n- **Influencer marketing ROI** — Micro-influencers (10K–100K) are delivering stronger engagement than celebrities\\n\\n---\\n\\n## My Recommendation\\nTo give you **industry-specific trend analysis**, I'd need your brand and sector details configured in the platform.\\n\\n**Would you like to discuss how any of these trends apply to your specific marketing goals?**", "timestamp": "2026-07-24T09:48:15.842Z"}]	2026-07-24 09:48:16.133935+00	2026-07-24 09:48:16.133935+00
635f5ae2-cda4-41ed-b335-83a02beba4a9	\N	cdf64f27-6438-4926-815a-94a8b16e7a71	\N	agency_ask	[{"role": "user", "content": "What's our best-performing brand this month?", "timestamp": "2026-07-24T11:47:09.951Z"}, {"role": "aria", "content": "# Brand Performance Inquiry\\n\\nThanks for the question, Chigozie. However, I don't currently have access to your **real-time campaign data or brand performance metrics** for this month.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Here's How to Find This Quickly:\\n\\n**In your Sabi Intelligence Suite dashboard:**\\n\\n1. Navigate to **Performance Overview** → Select current month\\n2. Sort brands by **key metrics** such as:\\n - Impressions & Reach\\n - Engagement Rate\\n - Share of Voice\\n - Conversion/ROI data\\n\\n---\\n\\n## What I Can Help With:\\n\\nOnce you identify your top performer, I can assist you with:\\n\\n- **Analysing *why* it's performing well** — audience fit, timing, creative direction\\n- **Replicating that success** across other brands in your portfolio\\n- **Identifying growth gaps** to maximise this month's momentum\\n\\n---\\n\\n> 💡 *If you'd like to share the numbers here, I'll give you a sharp strategic read on what's driving performance and where to double down.*\\n\\nShall I walk you through what strong performance benchmarks look like in your industry? 📊", "timestamp": "2026-07-24T11:47:16.240Z"}]	2026-07-24 11:47:16.76066+00	2026-07-24 11:47:16.76066+00
c5ae9236-6335-458b-9613-c617486836e7	\N	da244576-b1a6-4644-8b53-4d4d861902a9	\N	agency_ask	[{"role": "user", "content": "What's our best-performing brand this month?", "timestamp": "2026-07-27T08:16:01.365Z"}, {"role": "aria", "content": "I appreciate you asking, Damilola! However, I don't currently have access to your real-time campaign data or performance metrics directly within this conversation.\\n\\nTo get the most accurate answer on your **best-performing brand this month**, here's what I'd recommend:\\n\\n---\\n\\n**📊 Where to Find This in the Platform:**\\n\\n1. **Dashboard Overview** → Check the *Brand Performance Summary* widget for a quick month-to-date snapshot\\n2. **Reports Section** → Filter by *Current Month* and sort by your key KPIs (engagement, reach, conversions, etc.)\\n3. **Comparative Analytics** → Use the brand comparison view to see performance ranked side by side\\n\\n---\\n\\n**💡 What to Look For:**\\n- **Highest engagement rate** — not just volume\\n- **ROI or cost-per-result** trends\\n- **Share of Voice** relative to competitors\\n\\n---\\n\\nIf you'd like, you can **share the data or metrics** with me here, and I'll help you **interpret the results and recommend next steps** to either sustain or replicate that performance across your other brands.\\n\\nWould you like guidance on what metrics matter most for your industry? 🚀", "timestamp": "2026-07-27T08:16:08.455Z"}]	2026-07-27 08:16:08.584634+00	2026-07-27 08:16:08.584634+00
4baa288d-cd7f-4740-b8a5-65e87702897e	\N	7ef39ce2-9603-48b8-8b42-887d40bea6e5	\N	agency_ask	[{"role": "user", "content": "What's our best-performing brand this month?", "timestamp": "2026-07-28T11:45:41.395Z"}, {"role": "aria", "content": "# Brand Performance Inquiry\\n\\nThanks for the question, Charles. However, I don't currently have access to your **real-time campaign data or brand performance metrics** for this month.\\n\\nTo get that information, here's what I'd recommend:\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 📊 Where to Find This in the Platform:\\n\\n1. **Dashboard Overview** → Check the *Brand Performance Summary* widget for month-to-date rankings\\n2. **Reports Section** → Run a *Comparative Brand Report* filtered by current month\\n3. **Analytics Tab** → Sort by KPIs such as:\\n   - Engagement Rate\\n   - Share of Voice\\n   - Conversion Metrics\\n   - Reach & Impressions\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 💡 What I Can Help With:\\nOnce you pull that data, I can help you:\\n- **Interpret the numbers** and what they mean strategically\\n- **Identify growth opportunities** for underperforming brands\\n- **Benchmark against industry standards** in the Nigerian market\\n\\n---\\n\\nWould you like guidance on how to generate that report, or is there a specific brand you'd like to discuss strategically? I'm here to help you make the most of the insights.", "timestamp": "2026-07-28T11:45:48.583Z"}]	2026-07-28 11:45:48.724191+00	2026-07-28 11:45:48.724191+00
560484eb-fadf-467f-8ec2-07317bd50883	\N	44e04cc1-4227-4da7-aa63-1c7d58fae3d1	\N	agency_ask	[{"role": "user", "content": "What's our best-performing brand this month?", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T10:12:21.596Z"}, {"role": "aria", "content": "I appreciate you asking, but I don't currently have access to your **real-time performance data** for this month.\\n\\nTo find your best-performing brand, here's where to look in the **Sabi Intelligence Suite**:\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 📊 Here's What I'd Recommend:\\n\\n1. **Navigate to the Brand Performance Dashboard**\\n   - Filter by **\\"This Month\\"**\\n   - Sort by your key KPIs — reach, engagement, share of voice, or conversions\\n\\n2. **Check the Competitive Scorecard**\\n   - See how each brand stacks up against category benchmarks\\n\\n3. **Review the Executive Summary Report**\\n   - This gives you a snapshot ranking across all tracked brands\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 💡 Pro Tip:\\nIf you can **share the performance figures** with me directly in this chat, I can help you:\\n- **Interpret the data**\\n- **Identify what's driving the performance**\\n- **Recommend how to scale what's working**\\n\\n---\\n\\nWould you like guidance on **what metrics to prioritize** when evaluating brand performance in your industry? I'm happy to walk you through a framework.", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T10:12:28.079Z"}]	2026-07-30 10:12:28.201508+00	2026-07-30 10:12:28.201508+00
28c75356-308b-42fa-8531-e3773a316421	\N	9a2ab088-d0a6-4dfa-887d-58451e643555	\N	agency_ask	[{"role": "user", "content": "What's our best-performing brand this month?", "timestamp": "2026-08-11T10:58:34.767Z"}, {"role": "aria", "content": "Good day, Mary! 👋\\n\\nI appreciate you jumping straight to it — that's the executive mindset I'm here to support.\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Regarding your best-performing brand this month:**\\n\\nI don't currently have your live campaign data pulled up in this session. To get the precise figures, here's how to access it quickly:\\n\\n📊 **In the Sabi Intelligence Suite:**\\n> Navigate to **Dashboard → Brand Performance → Monthly Overview** and sort by your preferred KPI (Reach, Engagement, Conversions, or ROI).\\n\\n---\\n\\n**What I *can* help you with right now:**\\n\\n- ✅ **Interpret the numbers** once you pull them\\n- ✅ **Identify why** a brand may be outperforming others\\n- ✅ **Recommend next steps** to scale what's working\\n- ✅ **Benchmark performance** against industry standards in the Nigerian market\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Quick question for me to assist you better:**\\nAre you tracking multiple brands/product lines under one portfolio, or are you referring to performance across different marketing channels for a single brand?\\n\\nThat context will help me give you sharper, more relevant insights. 🎯", "timestamp": "2026-08-11T10:58:41.876Z"}]	2026-08-11 10:58:41.963922+00	2026-08-11 10:58:41.963922+00
1d719c8f-3f20-476d-b60c-5fd70ab6c3d0	\N	b8e62d10-724e-4a4b-aa50-d4f3f2b66100	\N	agency_ask	[{"role": "user", "content": "What Nigerian market trends should we be tracking?", "timestamp": "2026-08-18T07:00:25.212Z"}, {"role": "aria", "content": "# Nigerian Market Trends to Track\\n\\nGiven your industry context isn't fully configured yet, here are **high-impact trends** relevant across most Nigerian markets right now:\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📱 Digital & Consumer Behaviour\\n- **Mobile-first consumption** — 85%+ of Nigerian internet users are mobile-only\\n- **Social commerce growth** — Instagram, TikTok & WhatsApp driving purchase decisions\\n- **Short-form video dominance** — Reels & TikTok outperforming static content significantly\\n\\n## 💰 Economic Indicators\\n- **FX volatility impact** on consumer spending power & pricing strategy\\n- **Inflation-driven trade-down behaviour** — consumers shifting to value options\\n- **Fintech adoption** reshaping payment behaviour across demographics\\n\\n## 🎯 Audience Shifts\\n- **Gen Z influence** on purchase decisions beyond their own wallets\\n- **Secondary city growth** — Ibadan, Enugu, Port Harcourt gaining digital traction\\n- **Creator economy expansion** — influencer trust outpacing traditional media\\n\\n## 📊 Competitive Intelligence\\n- Competitor share-of-voice shifts on social platforms\\n- Category conversation trends on X (Twitter)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## My Recommendation\\nTo make this **truly relevant to your brand**, let's ensure your profile is fully set up on the Sabi platform.\\n\\n**Speak with your account manager** to configure your industry and brand parameters — then I can deliver precision insights specific to your category.\\n\\n*What area would you like to explore further?*", "timestamp": "2026-08-18T07:00:37.857Z"}]	2026-08-18 07:00:39.074312+00	2026-08-18 07:00:39.074312+00
