ccc6e753-fc5c-4181-beda-f22a68343036	215ffd37-e427-4cf6-9c75-ea4bcc7b3b79	draft	2026-07-29 21:03:47.876+00	\N	3	2026-07-29 09:38:03.009911+00	2026-07-29 09:38:03.009911+00	Test User 3 brings over five years of sharp strategic thinking to the creative marketing work that moves brands forward. As a Strategist, they have a knack for finding the idea underneath the obvious one and building campaigns that actually stick with people. Test User 3 approaches every brief with curiosity and a clear head, translating business goals into creative direction that teams can run with and audiences genuinely respond to. The kind of person you want in the room early.	{"Marketing Strategy","Campaign Planning","Audience Research"}
034a5a95-0457-4014-82fa-2f54a9cbbc97	248346b5-fab7-4220-b2d5-80c3c3b0cba7	draft	2026-07-31 11:25:21.86+00	\N	1	2026-07-31 11:25:22.472763+00	2026-07-31 11:25:22.472763+00	Matthew Bolarinwa is an Art Director who understands that great creative work does not happen by accident. With a sharp eye for visual storytelling and an instinct for what makes people stop and pay attention, he shapes the ideas that turn brands into conversations. Matthew brings both rigour and imagination to every brief, ensuring the work not only looks right but means something. He is the kind of creative mind that makes a team better and a campaign memorable.	{}
8ed92108-3eec-437f-a020-533d2789e320	2d5a01d6-0434-477e-ab72-8a3048b29cea	draft	2026-08-03 09:53:21.567+00	\N	1	2026-08-03 09:53:21.832366+00	2026-08-03 09:53:21.832366+00	Wale Ekundayo is the VP and Managing Director at the heart of everything creative here. As the brain behind the brand, he shapes the thinking, sets the direction, and makes sure the work that leaves this agency means something. With a sharp eye for what moves people and a clear sense of what makes a brand unforgettable, Wale brings both vision and execution to every project. Clients do not just get campaigns — they get strategy built by someone who genuinely understands the market.	{SEO,"Content Strategy","Keyword Research"}
\.
