48f083af-a16e-40a5-a7ed-bebbaff73a84	da76b34e-a8b0-4891-bc4f-2b8f62ba0d37	acaf0981-ccf3-4237-80ca-3aec56697f6c	\N	content_copy	The church announcement script	* ⁠We trust you were blessed by Pastor Wale’s topic last Tuesday. Pastor Wale will be continuing his teaching on the ‘The Four Quadrants’ with the topic ‘The Third Quadrant’ on the 11th of August, 2026.  The time as always is 6:30 pm. You don’t want to miss it. \n\n \n* Hello couples! It’s time to celebrate our couples celebrating their wedding anniversary. Join us for Celebration Sunday which comes up on the 16th of August, 2026. Service times are: 6:30 am, 8:15 am and 10:30 am.\n\n\n* The Be Women’s Conference holds at The Covenant Place beside The National Arts Theatre, Iganmu from the 15th to the 16th of August, 2026. Your speakers are Pastor Poju and Pastor Toyin Oyemade, Pastor Nike Adeyemi, Pastor Ifeanyi Adefarasin, Minister Lilian Nneji, Minister Omolara Akinbola, Tara Fela-Durotoye. Invite every woman you know.  \n\n\n* Our children’s summer camp kicks off from the 18th to the 21st of August 2026. To register your children kindly visit the Welcome  Centre.\n\n* Registration for the Teenagers Summer Camp is open. To register your teenagers kindly visit the Welcome  Centre.\n\n* There will be Water Baptism holding on the 22nd of August, 2026 by 10:30 am. To register use the link: linktr.ee/tcniganmulinks and then click ‘Water Baptism’. \n\n* The Children’s church is requesting for teachers and volunteers. Interested persons should visit the welcome center. \n\n* We  have an expectant and nursing mothers tribe for all pregnant and nursing mothers in church. Kindly visit the Welcome Center for more info to join the group.\n\n* Take beautiful photos of yourself in front of the banner at the entrance. Remember also to tell us what you learned in service and use the hashtag tcniganmusnaps.\n \nHave a blessed week!	0.0	[]	2026-08-05 18:08:22.965651+00	2026-08-05 18:08:22.965651+00	\N	[]
