77fc0f9c-23ed-43fc-9cca-9bdb7bccdc4b	37437b6c-7344-4558-bfa1-7b631de455da	4fb9abd7-e68c-4d3e-806c-c06c0da8456e	\N	content_copy	Drafted captions for design copy	In preparation for the launch of the new social media pages for Stanbic IBTC Pension Managers, I developed and consolidated social media captions to support the launch communication and ensure consistency across the different stages of the campaign.\n\nI created and populated a Google Sheet containing captions for the various content categories, including Teasers, Launch, Follow, GIFs/Videos, and Reveal, incorporating my captions alongside submissions from two other team members for review and refinement.\n\nI also created a second sheet within the same document containing the proposed social media bios and LinkedIn overview for Stanbic IBTC Pension Managers across Instagram, Facebook, X, and LinkedIn, ensuring each platform’s copy is appropriately tailored to its format and audience.\n\nAdditionally, based on the client's request, I created a separate Social Media Access Request Table for Stanbic IBTC Pension Managers. The table captures the required information for setting up and managing access across the social media platforms, including team member names, email addresses, devices to be used, 2FA requirements, social media channels, and other relevant access details.\n\nThis provides a centralised working document for the team to review, collaborate on, and efficiently manage the brand's social media launch and access requirements.	2.0	[]	2026-09-08 08:48:23.959056+00	2026-09-08 08:48:23.959056+00	\N	[]
